       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INDEXSETDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 DAY-NAMES-DATA.
           05 FILLER PIC X(9) VALUE "MONDAY   ".
           05 FILLER PIC X(9) VALUE "TUESDAY  ".
           05 FILLER PIC X(9) VALUE "WEDNESDAY".
           05 FILLER PIC X(9) VALUE "THURSDAY ".
           05 FILLER PIC X(9) VALUE "FRIDAY   ".
       01 DAY-TABLE REDEFINES DAY-NAMES-DATA.
           05 DAY-NAME PIC X(9) OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY DAY-IDX.
       01 POS-NUM     PIC 9.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET DAY-IDX TO 1
           DISPLAY "FIRST: " DAY-NAME(DAY-IDX)
           SET DAY-IDX UP BY 2
           DISPLAY "THIRD: " DAY-NAME(DAY-IDX)
           SET DAY-IDX DOWN BY 1
           DISPLAY "SECOND: " DAY-NAME(DAY-IDX)
           SET POS-NUM TO DAY-IDX
           DISPLAY "INDEX AS NUMBER: " POS-NUM

           SET DAY-IDX TO 5
           DISPLAY "LAST: " DAY-NAME(DAY-IDX)

           PERFORM VARYING DAY-IDX FROM 1 BY 2 UNTIL DAY-IDX > 5
               DISPLAY "EVERY OTHER: " DAY-NAME(DAY-IDX)
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.
